## KALUA Lua development

Author and validate KALUA apps headlessly with the CLI. Guide:
`./docs/agentic/development.md`. API reference (full copy):
`./.opencode/skills/kalua-api/api.md`.

- **Golden loop**: `./KALUA check app.lua` → `./KALUA run app.lua --test` → `./KALUA serve app.lua --test`
- **Machine-readable output**: append `--json` to `check`, `run --test`, `serve --test`, and `new`
- **Prefer `k.*` / `K.*` / expression functions over generic Lua** when an equivalent exists (`left`, `upper`, `round`, `sys_date`, `k.http_request`, `k.csv_parse`, `k.file_*`, …)
- **Fix the suffix**: `new` appends `.lua` automatically and refuses to overwrite existing files.

Exit codes: 0 ok · 1 script/runtime error · 2 usage · 3 I/O error.
